<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Dear {!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Thank you for registering for the Overnight Experience as part of your Scholar Day event at the Downtown Phoenix campus. Please keep this email confirmation for your records.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>Overnight Experience arrival information</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Date: </b>Wednesday, Nov. 11 – Thursday, Nov. 12, 2015</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Check-in: </b>5 – 5:30 p.m.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Program:</b> 5:30 p.m. – 8 a.m.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Location:</b> Check-in at the dining facility in Taylor Place.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>&nbsp;120 E. Taylor St.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span>&nbsp;Phoenix, AZ 85004</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>Overnight Event driving and parking</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Parking requires a reservation or you will be ticketed. If you wish to park on the Downtown Phoenix campus, contact <a href="mailto:susan.estby@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Susan Estby</font></a> to make your reservation.</b> Once you make a reservation, you will be allowed to park in the <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=62652"><font color="#990000">McKinley Visitor Parking Lot</font></a> located on McKinley Street between First Street and Second Street. Please park in one of the lot’s numbered spaces. View <a href="http://www.asu.edu/map/directions.html"><font color="#990000">driving directions</font></a> and a <a href="http://asu.edu/parking/maps/downtown-current.pdf"><font color="#990000">map of parking locations</font></a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>Please note:</b> Students will not be permitted to leave campus once checked-in to the program.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>What to bring</b></font></div><div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Bring a change of clothing, sleeping bag, pillow, towel and any personal items (medication, soap, etc.). If you need to borrow a sleeping bag, please let&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="mailto:susan.estby@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Susan Estby</font></a></span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">&nbsp;know. To store your luggage during Scholar&nbsp;Day, bring it with you to the Nov. 12 check-in at 7:30 a.m.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>What to send ahead of time</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">All participants must complete <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/0BwVFAJYFrO9wRGl1U2JIcGVObXc/view?usp=sharing"><font color="#990000">student waivers</font></a> to stay overnight in the residence hall. If you are under the age of 18, you must have your parent or guardian complete the form. Email the completed form to&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="mailto:susan.estby@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Susan Estby</font></a></span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>Scholar Day check-in</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Please note that Overnight Experience participants will be provided breakfast before the day’s events begin.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Check-in begins Nov. 12 at 7:30 a.m. in the Barrett Suite in <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=63248"><font color="#990000">University Center</font></a> 160 (UCENT) for students who stayed overnight or those who want to depart from the Downtown Phoenix campus. We will then transport you to the Tempe campus for the Scholar Day programming.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" size="4"><b>Guest information</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Guests may participate in the Scholar Day event on Nov. 12. Please refer to the confirmation email you received for the Scholar Day program to coordinate your guest’s arrival time and meeting location. For guests planning to stay overnight, check out <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/enhance/dtphx#link-lodging"><font color="#990000">special ASU rates at local hotels</font></a> and <a href="http://phoenix.gov/visitors/index.html"><font color="#990000">information regarding the city of Phoenix and surrounding areas</font></a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Transportation will be provided between the Downtown Phoenix and Tempe campuses for students and guests.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><div><font face="arial"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Parking option 1:</b> Guests may select to park at Tempe campus (use visitor parking in the <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=65174"><font color="#990000">Apache Boulevard structure</font></a>, <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=65173"><font color="#990000">Rural Road structure</font></a> or <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=113245"><font color="#990000">Fulton structure</font></a>) and meet their student there, travel to Downtown Phoenix campus and return to Tempe campus.&nbsp;</font></div></div></blockquote><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div></div><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><div><div><font face="arial"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Parking option 2:</b> Reserve parking at Downtown Phoenix campus (use numbered spaces in the <a href="https://maps.asu.edu/?id=120&amp;mrkIid=62652"><font color="#990000">McKinley Visitor Parking Lot</font></a>) through Susan Estby at <a href="susan.estby@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">susan.estby@asu.edu</font></a>, travel to Tempe campus, and return to Downtown Phoenix campus.&nbsp;</font></div></div></blockquote><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">If you have questions regarding this event, please contact&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="mailto:susan.estby@asu.edu"><font color="#990000">Susan Estby</font></a></span><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">. We’re&nbsp;looking forward to hosting you for this exciting event.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Naomi Hillsman</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Assistant Director</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">602-496-2035</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">visit.asu.edu</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>